// 1-15: red comes back, and with all three colours, white true view. Secrets: a hidden chip, a white bridge, a tower shortcut.
id l1-15
name 1-15 RED SHIFT
tagline the last colour in the modem. it's been waiting.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main red white secret
mechanics current:1 plank:3 anchor:1 colour:1 red:3 white:3 secret:1 chip:1
new red white secret chip
portion 5 swing and let go over the red ledge
portion 5 white bridge in true view
portion 4 chip behind a secret wall, slot door
hardness 4.7
map
