text TWO WAYS ACROSS. SWING, AND LET GO ABOVE THE RED LEDGE.\nOR HOLD {recal} FOR TRUE VIEW:\nSOME FLOORS ONLY SHOW UP IN WHITE. || SWINGS AND THE LENS DON'T MIX: TRUE VIEW DROPS THE ROPE.\nSWING, LET GO, THEN HOLD {recal}: WHITE SHOWS THE RED LEDGE.\nOR HOLD IT FROM THE START: SOME FLOORS ONLY SHOW UP IN WHITE.
text A SLOT. IT WANTS A DATA CHIP.\nCHIPS HIDE WHERE ONLY TRUE VIEW LOOKS.\nWALK INTO ONE TO PICK IT UP. BRING IT HERE.
text RED. THE LAST COLOUR IN THE MODEM. TAP {jack} TO PLUG IN.\nWITH ALL THREE, HOLD {recal} FOR TRUE VIEW (WHITE).\nSOME WALLS AREN'T WALLS. || RED. THE LAST COLOUR IN THE MODEM. TAP {jack} TO PLUG IN.\nFROM NOW ON {recal} IS TRUE VIEW: WHITE, EVERY COLOUR AT ONCE.\nIT DRAINS FAST. SOME WALLS AREN'T WALLS.
entity {"type": "connector", "x": 9, "y": 21, "color": "red"}
entity {"type": "anchor", "x": 39, "y": 7}
entity {"type": "chip", "x": 26, "y": 22}
entity {"type": "slot", "x": 75, "y": 16, "id": "k1"}
entity {"type": "gate", "x": 76, "y": 15, "h": 3, "inputs": ["k1"]}
zone red 0 0 17 30
zone red 42 0 10 30
zone red 68 0 7 18
exit 85 2 2 8
